    narr:narration """On 20260718, QuintonFairweather announced the adoption decision in plain terms — [adoption declared for the analytics pipeline](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1) — and grounded it immediately in a performance claim: [15x columnar-query speed advantage over the current setup](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2). A timeline commitment followed: [migration starting next quarter](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3). The session then restated these three elements as settled bullets — [Zypherion named as the analytics database](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4), [15x columnar improvement recorded as the performance finding](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5), and [Q3 2026 fixed as the migration start](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6). The hub covers: the decision itself, its stated performance rationale, and its timeline. It does not cover vendor evaluation alternatives, cost analysis, rollback plans, or downstream schema implications.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We are adopting Zypherion for the analytics pipeline." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "It handles columnar queries 15x faster than our current setup." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The migration starts next quarter." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Database**: Zypherion for analytics" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Performance**: 15x improvement on columnar queries" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Timeline**: Migration starts Q3 2026" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The timeline is stated two ways without reconciliation: Quinton says 'next quarter' (relative, irrealis) while the session bullet fixes 'Q3 2026' (absolute) — the referent of 'next quarter' from 20260718 is inferrable but not confirmed identical." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The 15x figure is asserted as a present-realis fact by Quinton but carries no cited benchmark, test scope, or query-type qualification — the session bullet restates it without adding that context." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "All six children support the decision; no child challenges, qualifies, or records dissent — the absence of a narr:challenges child is itself a structural feature worth noting if this hub is queried for risk or opposition." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4> ] ;
